Add documentation for the Rockchip MIPI CSI-2 Receiver.

Signed-off-by: Michael Riesch <michael.riesch@wolfvision.net>
Reviewed-by: Krzysztof Kozlowski <krzysztof.kozlowski@oss.qualcomm.com>
